      "mergeID": "636040efd6c5e040bb980149",
      "mergedPostDetails": "Creator Companion is Windows only. Many Quest users do not use Windows and create their content on Linux or Mac, which has worked perfectly fine to this day, SDK and everything. Creator Companion distribution artificially bars them from properly creating avatars and worlds for VRChat.\nPlease consider utilizing a multiplatform framework for the Creator Companion, so as not to exclude enthusiastic creators in our community who may have been building avatars and worlds for years previously unimpeded.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Multiplatform Creator Companion",
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "62850b96f29caa0b874aaef4",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": {
        "like": 1
      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Or continue to provide direct SDK downloads via some means, for those unable to use the companion if it remains Windows only.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
